# Chain parameters (/arbitrum-essentials/reference/chain-params)

## Chain parameters [#chain-parameters]

| Parameter                | Description                                                                                                                                      | Arbitrum One                                                                                              | Arbitrum Nova                                                                                         | Arbitrum Sepolia                                                                                            |
| ------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **Dispute window**       | Period in which a validator can challenge an assertion before the assertion is confirmed | 45818 blocks (about 6.4 days)       | 45818 blocks (about 6.4 days)       | 20 blocks (about 4.0 minutes) |
| **Minimum bond amount**  | Funds that a proposer must bond to propose an assertion on the parent chain                                       | 3600 ETH                                                                     | 1 ETH                                                                   | 1 Sepolia ETH                                                              |
| **Force-include period** | Time after which a delayed message can enter the inbox without the sequencer                                         | 7200 blocks / 24 hours | 7200 blocks / 24 hours | 5760 blocks / 24 hours |
| **Gas target**           | Gas per second above which the congestion mechanism starts                                                                                       | [See child chain gas fees](/how-arbitrum-works/deep-dives/gas-and-fees#child-chain-gas-fees)              | [See child chain gas fees](/how-arbitrum-works/deep-dives/gas-and-fees#child-chain-gas-fees)          | [See child chain gas fees](/how-arbitrum-works/deep-dives/gas-and-fees#child-chain-gas-fees)                |
| **Gas price floor**      | Minimum gas price                                                                                                                                | 0.02 gwei                                                                    | 0.02 gwei                                                                  | 0.2 gwei                                                                     |
| **Block gas limit**      | Maximum total gas that the transactions in one block can use                                                                                     | 32,000,000                                                                        | 32,000,000                                                                      | 32,000,000                                                                         |

## Current gas targets [#current-gas-targets]



### Arbitrum One [#arbitrum-one]

| Gas target (Mgas/s) | Adjustment window (seconds) |
| ------------------- | --------------------------- |
| **60**              | 9                           |
| **41**              | 52                          |
| **29**              | 329                         |
| **20**              | 2,105                       |
| **14**              | 13,485                      |
| **10**              | 86,400                      |

### Arbitrum Nova [#arbitrum-nova]

Arbitrum Nova uses a single gas target of 7,000,000 gas/s (7 Mgas/s) and no adjustment windows.

### Arbitrum Sepolia [#arbitrum-sepolia]

| Gas target (Mgas/s) | Adjustment window (seconds) |
| ------------------- | --------------------------- |
| **60**              | 9                           |
| **41**              | 52                          |
| **29**              | 329                         |
| **20**              | 2,105                       |
| **14**              | 13,485                      |
| **10**              | 86,400                      |

For more about the gas target, see [Gas and fees deep dive](/how-arbitrum-works/deep-dives/gas-and-fees#the-gas-target).

To configure the gas target for your Arbitrum chain, see [Dynamic pricing for Arbitrum chains](/launch-arbitrum-chain/chain-config/costs/dynamic-pricing). To calculate the values, see [How to calculate the values for your chain](/launch-arbitrum-chain/chain-config/costs/dynamic-pricing#how-to-calculate-the-values-for-your-chain).

