# RPC endpoints and providers (/arbitrum-essentials/reference/node-providers)

## Arbitrum public RPC endpoints [#arbitrum-public-rpc-endpoints]

Use these public RPC endpoints to connect to Arbitrum One, Arbitrum Nova, and Arbitrum Sepolia.

> **Warning**
>
> - Unlike the RPC URLs, the sequencer endpoints support only `eth_sendRawTransaction` and `eth_sendRawTransactionConditional` calls.
> - The Arbitrum public RPC endpoints do not support WebSocket.
> - The Arbitrum public RPC endpoints do not support IPv6.

| Name                           | RPC URL                                  | Chain ID | Block explorer                                                                                   | Underlying chain | Tech stack       | Sequencer feed URL                      | Sequencer endpoint                                 |
| ------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ | ---------------- | ---------------- | --------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------- |
| **Arbitrum One**               | `https://arb1.arbitrum.io/rpc`           | 42161    | [Arbiscan](https://arbiscan.io/), [Blockscout](https://arbitrum.blockscout.com/)                 | Ethereum         | Nitro (Rollup)   | `wss://arb1-feed.arbitrum.io/feed`      | `https://arb1-sequencer.arbitrum.io/rpc`           |
| **Arbitrum Nova**              | `https://nova.arbitrum.io/rpc`           | 42170    | [Blockscout](https://arbitrum-nova.blockscout.com/)                                              | Ethereum         | Nitro (AnyTrust) | `wss://nova-feed.arbitrum.io/feed`      | `https://nova-sequencer.arbitrum.io/rpc`           |
| **Arbitrum Sepolia (Testnet)** | `https://sepolia-rollup.arbitrum.io/rpc` | 421614   | [Arbiscan](https://sepolia.arbiscan.io/), [Blockscout](https://arbitrum-sepolia.blockscout.com/) | Sepolia          | Nitro (Rollup)   | `wss://sepolia-rollup.arbitrum.io/feed` | `https://sepolia-rollup-sequencer.arbitrum.io/rpc` |

> **More RPC endpoints**
>
> Chain Connect lists more RPC endpoints for [Arbitrum One](https://www.alchemy.com/chain-connect/chain/arbitrum-one) and [Arbitrum Nova](https://www.alchemy.com/chain-connect/chain/arbitrum-nova).

## Third-party RPC providers [#third-party-rpc-providers]

You can also connect to public Arbitrum chains through many of the node providers that you use on Ethereum.

> **Add your project to this list**
>
> To add your project to this list and to the [Arbitrum portal](https://portal.arbitrum.one/), complete the [portal application form](https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSc_v8j7sc4ffE6U-lJJyLMdBoIubf7OIhGtCqvK3cGPGoLr7w/viewform).

> **Get support for Nova third-party tools**
>
> To request support for a Nova third-party tool, complete the [Nova support form](https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfL1SlycJDyeRQJg-izdFZgN0eqLLAuzHkOr4TIEAZlcuBfSg/viewform).

| Provider                                                                                   | Arbitrum One | Arbitrum Nova | Arbitrum Sepolia | WebSocket | Stylus tracing                 |
| ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ | ------------ | ------------- | ---------------- | --------- | ------------------------------ |
